2 CONT
2 CONT '''TABLE 4'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Anders Appelbom''' (son of Anders Appelbom, table 3 ). Registrar in the Royal Chancellery. Should have then become an officer in Holland and died abroad before 1687. '''Married 1667-06-04 in Stockholm to Anna Behmer, daughter o
2 CONC f court councilor Daniel Behmer and his 1st wife Brita Schulte.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Harald Andersson Appelblom,''' born in 1669. Deputy attorney general. Died 1730
2 CONT
