2 CONT * Beata Kristoffersdotter was both Stjärna and Svinhuvud, the father was the mountain bailiff Kristoffer Olsson /stjärna/ and modern wife Anna Persdotter?/ at Korsnäs who was still alive in 1546. Beata Jönsdotter's father Jöns Ben
2 CONC gtsson was a copper miner first at Kämparvet later in Klingsbo in Skedvi.
