2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000002514779641&photo_id=6000000194350604029&position=0 Kristoffer Olofsson's maternal grandfather was the miner Jöns Hansson at Höjen, mentioned 1450-1452. What wa
2 CONC s previously known about his (Kristoffer's) daughter Beata was that she was the mother of the mountain man first in Kämparvet and later in Klingsbo Jöns Bengtsson (died 1612/13). The family investigation in this case in Svea Hovrä
2 CONC tt shows that she must have later remarried to the armorer at Halla in Björksta in Västmanland Jon Larsson (beam with three roses)and died around 1543 (Svea Hovrätt, Huvudserie (Liber causarum), SE/RA/ 420422/01/E VI a 2 aa/126 (1
