2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Info; Riddarhuset Ättartavlor 2021
2 CONT
2 CONT Pro obs! His wife's parents were changed which means that Johan Fredrik's offspring does no longer belong to the Bure family.
