1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Isaac Clason''', född 1710 och död 1772, var en svensk grosshandlare och politiker, av släkten Clason.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gift 20 maj 1740 i Örebro med Sara Magdalena Wittfoth, f. 8 maj 1722, d 9 okt. 1793, dotter till handlanden Karl Wittfoth i Örebro. https://digi.kansalliskirjasto.fi/teos/binding/2206767?page=1
2 CONT
2 CONT https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Isaac_Clason
2 CONT
2 CONT https://sok.riksarkivet.se/sbl/Presentation.aspx?id=14868
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Bio notes: Influencial member of the "Hat Party" and representant of the bourgeoisie during the years 1755-1756 and 1760-1762, his political party that held power during the "Freedom Period" of swedish history (Twas an epoch when 
2 CONC the parliament was in charge of the nation, it was followed by the Gustavian Period, that occured when the king, Gustav III, couped the goverment, to restore his monarchial powers). He was a very passionate about the expansionist 
2 CONC economic policies of the time, he was involved in the "Köningska bill office", and for this when the system changed and the "Mouse Party" he was punished by being forced into bankruptcy for a few years, when his party to power his
2 CONC  punishment was lifted, but still, the damage was done and his business never recovered.
